# iOS and Android release tooling artefacts, not repo docs:
#   - <platform>/vendor/** is `bundle install --path vendor/bundle`, i.e. third-party gem READMEs
#   - <platform>/fastlane/README.md is GENERATED by `fastlane docs`, rewritten on every lane change
# All untracked build output; linting it fails on prose we neither wrote nor may edit.
#
# The android pair was missing until 2026-10-01: iOS fastlane came first and took these two lines
# with it, then Android fastlane landed and did not. `make lint-markdown` went red on 7 vendored
# gem READMEs — invisible in CI, which clones fresh and never runs `bundle install` here, so it
# only ever failed for someone who had actually built the Android app.
web/learning-player/ios/vendor/
web/learning-player/ios/fastlane/README.md
web/learning-player/android/vendor/
web/learning-player/android/fastlane/README.md
